OL,3,GNEWSACouncil warned of 'unsustainable'
OL,4,Afinances again
OL,5,
OL,6,FCroydon Council has been warned again
OL,7,Fthat its financial position is
OL,8,F"unsustainable", with it remaining
OL,9,Freliant on government support.
OL,11,FThe assessment came in a second report
OL,12,Ffrom government-appointed
OL,13,Fcommissioners, who were installed
OL,14,Ffollowing the council's financial
OL,15,Fcollapse.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
