OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil warned of 'unsustainable'
OL,4,Afinances again
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe south London council was granted
OL,7,FExceptional Financial Support (EFS) to
OL,8,Fhelp balance its annual budgets, and
OL,9,Fwhile its debt had reduced,
OL,10,Fcommissioners warned the council had to
OL,11,Fdemonstrate sustained financial
OL,12,Fcontrol.
OL,14,FMayor Jason Perry acknowledged the
OL,15,Fchallenge of relying on EFS and said it
OL,16,Fwas difficult to "see a route out" of
OL,17,Fthe programme that did not include
OL,18,F"some form of government intervention".
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
